                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "at 39 years old there isn't much that makes me feel like a kid, but this game did it.  I positioned the game table at shoulder height and stand right in the middle of the game.  feels like I am a kid playing on the floor preteding to blow thigs up.  my favorite is the tornado.  when I release it I get right up close to it and it makes me smile every time.  I loved tower defense games on the phone, but this is a whole new experience.  All and all one of the best games I have played in VR.  Thanks to the folks that put this one together.",
